       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    CCATREAD.
       AUTHOR.        KURT MOVSESIAN.
       INSTALLATION.  GTR.
       DATE-COMPILED.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MESSAGE-FILE-PF
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFP000100
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS MSGFILEP-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MESSAGE-FILE-PF
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MESSAGE-RCD-NO.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFP000100.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01  MSGFILEP-STATUS                    PIC XX.
       01  OPEN-SW                            PIC X VALUE "Y".

        LINKAGE SECTION.

      *********************************************
      **  PARAMETERS FOR CALLING 'CATREAD'.      **
      **  CATREAD RETRIEVES A MESSAGE FROM THE   **
      **  MESSAGE FILE.                          **
      *********************************************

       01  CATREAD-PARMS.
           05  CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER         PIC 9(5).
           05  CATREAD-MSG-BREAKDOWN REDEFINES CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER.
               10  CATREAD-MSG-SET        PIC 9(2).
               10  CATREAD-MSG-NUM        PIC 9(3).
           05  CATREAD-MSG-TEXT           PIC X(80).
           05  CATREAD-RETURN-FLAG        PIC X(1).
               88  CATREAD-MSG-FOUND                   VALUE "Y".
               88  CATREAD-MSG-NOT-FOUND               VALUE "N".
           05  FILLER                     PIC X(20).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CATREAD-PARMS.
       BEGIN.
           IF OPEN-SW = "Y"
             MOVE "N" TO OPEN-SW
             OPEN INPUT MESSAGE-FILE-PF.

           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.

           GOBACK.

        6-MAIN.
           MOVE SPACES           TO CATREAD-MSG-TEXT.
           MOVE "N"              TO CATREAD-RETURN-FLAG.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               GO TO 6-MAIN-X.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER TO MSGNUM OF MESSAGE-RCD-NO.
           MOVE ZEROS            TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER.
           READ MESSAGE-FILE-PF
               INVALID KEY
                   GO TO 6-MAIN-X.
           MOVE MESSAG OF MESSAGE-RCD-NO  TO CATREAD-MSG-TEXT.
           MOVE "Y"              TO CATREAD-RETURN-FLAG.

       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.
